  "1": [
   "Soups from the allotment\rPip Tanager\rLeek and potato soup\rA soup for cold evenings, from the second bed of the allotment.\u0002\rIngredients for four bowls\rIngredient\r\u0007Amount\r\u0007\r\u0007Leeks\r\u00073\r\u0007\r\u0007Potatoes\r\u0007500 g\r\u0007\r\u0007Stock\r\u00071 l\r\u0007\r\u0007Slice the leeks.\rDice the potatoes.\rSimmer for twenty minutes.\r/\rA dark bird shape on a pale green ground\rSee the seed list for the varieties.\rNettle soup\rPick the young tops in spring.\rNettles lose their sting when they are cooked.\r"
